episode_metadata.question:
A 6 cm by X cm rectangle is inscribed in a circle. What is the number of centimeters in the circumference of the circle? Express your answer in terms of $\pi$.

[asy]import graph;
defaultpen(linewidth(0.7));
draw(Circle((0,0),20));
draw((-16,-12)--(16,-12)--(16,12)--(-16,12)--cycle);
[/asy]
If we know the answer to the above question is 10\pi, what is the value of unknown variable X?

